 "description": "Audit one IAM policy and report what widens it. The findings that need the document read as a whole: a wildcard action together with a wildcard resource, which means more than either alone; a Deny whose resource patterns no Allow in the policy covers, so it constrains nothing it appears to; and NotAction or NotResource in an Allow, which defines the permitted set by exclusion so the policy widens whenever the cloud gains an action, without the document changing. Pay 200000 atomic USDC on Base via exact x402. MCP does not pay; it provides a challenge handoff.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "policy": {
    "description": "The policy to audit. An IAM policy document as JSON text. Statement may be a single object or an array. Nothing is fetched: no cloud account is contacted and no credential is accepted, so the document supplied is the whole input.",
    "example": "{\n \"Version\": \"2008-10-17\",\n \"Statement\": [\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"Admin\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n   \"Action\": \"*\",\n   \"Resource\": \"*\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"AllButBilling\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n   \"NotAction\": [\n    \"aws-portal:*\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:s3:::reports/*\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"IamWide\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n   \"Action\": [\n    \"iam:*\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/app\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"DenyElsewhere\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Deny\",\n   \"Action\": [\n    \"s3:*\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:s3:::other-account-bucket/*\"\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}",
    "maxLength": 262144,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "require_conditions_on_wildcards": {
    "description": "Report a wildcard statement with no Condition. Defaults to true, since nothing then narrows it at evaluation time.",
    "type": "boolean"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "policy"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "iam_policy_structural_audit",
